   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 360 sky or backdrop panorama\n**VTube Pro workflow, 8 GB graphics card** (SDXL). Pack 2026.10.01.\n\nA wrap-around sky or far backdrop (sunset city, space, forest) for outside your windows.\n\n## How to use it\n1. Describe the place in \"Your prompt\". Keep \"horizon in the middle\".\n2. Press Run. The left and right edges are joined for you.\n3. Find the result in ComfyUI's **output/VTubePro** folder (or right-click the picture > Save Image).\n\nThe **green boxes** are the ones to change.\n\n**You get:** 4096x2048 PNG (2:1, wraps left to right).\n\n**In VTube Pro:** Put it on your room's sky mesh with a material named M_Sky (or SKY_...) so the room's lighting tints it.\n\n**Settings:** 1536x768, left-right seam repainted, Real-ESRGAN to 4096x2048.\n\n## Models (all allow commercial use)\n- [sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0) (6.9 GB) in `models/checkpoints`: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M\n- [RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Real-ESRGAN_repackaged) (0.1 GB) in `models/upscale_models`: BSD-3-Clause\n\nMissing a model? ComfyUI offers to download it when you open this workflow. Or ask your AI: \n*\"Set up the VTube Pro 360 sky workflow in ComfyUI\"*: the VTube Pro Helper downloads every file from its official page, checks it, and adds this workflow, after you say yes.\n\n## Tips\n- Plain sky at the top and plain ground at the bottom hide the stretching.\n- Keep people out of panoramas.\n- Make pictures when you are not live: picture AI slows face tracking."
   ],
   "title": "Start here",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
